  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Mission
  goal: 0
  help: 'WOLF HUNT. The Garuda is hunting you. Find it before it finds you.

    -
    Keep your power low. Every unit you draw makes you louder.

    - DRADIS and
    fighters help you find it. ACTIVE SCAN finds it fast, but makes you loud.

    -
    Destroy it or capture it. A jump point then opens at the edge of the map. Fly
    to it to win.

    - If it finds you, enemy frigates arrive 3 minutes later.'
